Cell["\<\
MultiAtomBasis[na, nl] : na, nl \[Element] Integers
Returns a SparseArray containing a multi atom basis for na atoms with nl \
quantum levels each.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954877465108873*^9, 3.954877503198399*^9}, 
