  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"d78f9075-04c7-4ebb-968e-9e2f45a51d90"],
 " for the \[Alpha]-th atom of a system consisting of na atoms with nl \
quantum levels."
}], "Text",
