Cell["\<\
LiouvilleCommutator[h, H] : h, H \[Element] SparseArray
Returns a SparseArray of dimension  Length[h] that contains the Liouville \
superoperator corresponding to the commutator i[H, \[Rho]] of the  master \
equation or to the commutator i[H, Q] of the adjoint master equation. It is \
important to notice that in the case of the master equation it is important \
to set the sign of the Liouville superoperator to negative. In contrast, in \
the adjoint master equation, this adjustment is not necessary.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954878897778723*^9, 3.954878905190978*^9}, {
   3.954878942620962*^9, 3.954878970514427*^9}, {3.95487900917933*^9, 
