Cell["\<\
LiouvilleMasterEquation[q, Li, t] : q, Li \[Element] SparseArray,  t is a \
Mathematica symbol that represents the time variable
Returns a List of dimension  Length[q] = Length[Li] that contains the \
Liouville differential equations that correspond to the Liouville \
superoperator Li which includes both the Lindbladian and Hamiltonian parts \
generated using LiouvilleCommutator and LiouvilleLindbladian. The variable q \
should be a list of the density matrix coefficients, i.e., Tr[h \[Rho](t)] .\
\>", "Text",
