Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Example", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954934528317594*^9, 3.9549345300556*^9}, 
   3.964030641541395*^9},ExpressionUUID->"17150541-c5ed-4d38-83ca-\
2e1d1005d01c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Generate the differential equations of the Heisenberg picture basis \
matrices  that arise from a system consisting of two (na=2) three level \
(nl=3) atoms subject to two lasers with Rabi parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4514f355-813a-422d-9409-ee640bbb47ca"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9bb6003a-0df0-48c9-987e-b41820b8b395"],
 " and detuning parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "15cf00f0-770b-4efe-8bfc-1cb626336fb3"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "38b35eef-03f4-4a1a-aee4-2156f18fce94"],
 ", respectively. The first laser couples the states \[VerticalSeparator]1\
\[RightAngleBracket] and \[VerticalSeparator]2\[RightAngleBracket] with a \
Rabi parameter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6b559db4-6254-43f7-a26d-23c87e3dc585"],
 " and the second couples \[VerticalSeparator]2\[RightAngleBracket] and \
\[VerticalSeparator]3\[RightAngleBracket] with a Rabi parameter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["R", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f0ac8ec1-bfb4-4745-9c74-d45455572f36"],
 " for both atoms. Both atoms are at different positions along the \
light-propagation direction and therefore have a phase difference \[Phi]. The \
transCE configuration variable that describes this light-matter interaction is"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGAQBmIQnTHdKq2g/K1jf218IYj2ufizAUR/X/+jB0T7Gzqc
