Cell["\<\
CleanUp[Op] : Op \[Element] SparseArray
Returns a SparseArray of dimension Length[Op] with a cleaner set of \
ArrayRules. For example, in some cases it might eliminate vanishing imaginary \
elements.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954878897778723*^9, 3.954878905190978*^9}, {
