  "ee45f1b3-827e-44dd-97ac-2e8a77e27460"],
 " \[VerticalSeparator] j, m \[RightAngleBracket] as given by \
GlebschGordan[{j1, m1}, {j2, m2}, {j, m}], provided that the triangular \
condition \[VerticalSeparator]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["j", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5c818482-b275-4d93-a394-7d12df8f8203"],
