   SubscriptBox["m", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f271218e-24f8-4146-8bbb-7085f2729663"],
 " = 2, j = 4 and m=3 and, then the triangular and the magnetic quantum \
number conditions are met, and the function returns the  Clebsch-Gordan \
coefficient"
}], "Text",
