  "90349617-b4cb-4562-bba5-6333b3243025"],
 " = 3, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["m", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c4a3f65f-8785-4fd1-bb11-90de779145c2"],
 " = 2,  j = 6 and m = 3, these conditions are not satisfied, and the \
function returns zero."
}], "Text",
