 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]\[Epsilon]", "7"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"791248de-34f9-48fa-8942-57c9aac219a9"],
 " correspond to the quantum levels involved in the transitions. The variable \
transLi has a similar structure, however it can also couple transitions from \
the same atoms"
}], "Text",
