   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9682488211240797`*^9, 3.9682488266131783`*^9}, 
   3.9682489943657913`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[56]:=",ExpressionUUID->"37a2f98b-40fc-4e1a-8dad-879ee2145010"],

Cell["\<\
and that the wave lenght is 0.780 \[Mu]m, the imaginary part of the Green\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s function is\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968248895153452*^9, 
  3.96824896633829*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"125c828b-9241-4ab2-a022-\
a40a7aa698c7"],

