Cell["\<\
It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s possible to shorten the process of obtaining the \
differential equations by using MasterEquation, which is a wrapper for \
LiouvilleMasterEquation, LiouvilleLindbladian, LiouvilleCommutator, and Ham\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964876340979529*^9, 3.9648763795249147`*^9}, {
