Cell["\<\
In simpler cases one may be able to obtain an analytical solution. For \
example, if the drive is turned off and the system is initially in the \
excited state \[VerticalSeparator]2\[RightAngleBracket] , we readily obtain \
the typical equations for spontaneous emission\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964874555680763*^9, 3.964874649244903*^9}, {
  3.971287511786236*^9, 3.97128752202122*^9}, {3.978605408307795*^9, 
