   3.964868353934239*^9, 3.964868374400247*^9}, {3.964877915514298*^9, 
   3.964877924870549*^9}, 3.96487796015759*^9, 3.965225124021002*^9, {
   3.965237681985787*^9, 3.9652376888427076`*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "Two two-level \
atoms",ExpressionUUID->"810866ba-f5d1-4c59-9bdf-f342b8577ddf"],

Cell["\<\
We set up the master equation for two two-level atoms. Using its solution, we \
plot the time dependence of the quantum-level populations. We also perform a \
spectroscopic analysis of the emission by sweeping the detuning and \
evaluating the correlation between the emissions of the two atoms. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96531522401501*^9, 3.965315233164456*^9}, 
   3.96531534363879*^9, {3.965315499764625*^9, 3.965315518129793*^9}, {
   3.965316069507265*^9, 
   3.965316152317426*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1ca8aae1-3e40-436c-8ea8-\
6e169373ac83"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 ButtonBox["\<\"Content\"\>",
  Appearance->Automatic,
  BaseStyle->{FontColor -> RGBColor[
      Rational[1, 3], 
      Rational[1, 3], 1]},
  ButtonFunction:>NotebookLocate["Content"],
  Evaluator->Automatic,
  Method->"Preemptive"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.967476292796187*^9},ExpressionUUID->"7111e809-520c-4156-be8f-\
18a49d3b2457"]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.967476644055934*^9},ExpressionUUID->"5c5c1370-f880-4aa8-9eae-\
f68620d394f8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Example", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965315356316115*^9, 
  3.965315357301752*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1f3f3ffe-0607-4cc1-8e58-\
9197126ccc53"],

Cell["Load MultiAtomLiouvilleEquationGenerator", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964876966723848*^9, 
  3.964876976051291*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"24192fab-70e8-4607-aec3-\
cd419be37ebd"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
  "SetDirectory", "[", "PathToMultiAtomLiouvilleEquationGenerator", "]"}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<MultiAtomLiouvilleEquationGenerator`\>\"", 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.965317081041462*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[205]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7c6a4de7-5905-4215-a569-069afabbb65b"],

Cell["\<\
We start by setting the matrix basis. We set  the number of atoms (na) and \
the number of quantum levels (nl) per atom.  We then set the dimension of the \
Hilbert space (n) , define the basis (h) and create the time-dependent \
density matrix coefficients (\[Rho][t])\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964870476853927*^9, 3.964870506502221*^9}, {
   3.964872674609602*^9, 3.9648726790460873`*^9}, {3.967131186439439*^9, 
   3.967131186938508*^9}, 
   3.971288164156274*^9},ExpressionUUID->"230049b0-19bc-495f-8481-\
223b4b899a52"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"na", "=", "2"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"nl", "=", "2"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", 
   SuperscriptBox["nl", 
    RowBox[{"2", "na"}]]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"h", "=", 
  RowBox[{"MultiAtomBasis", "[", 
   RowBox[{"nl", ",", "na"}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"rho", "=", 
  RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ii", "->", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "ii"], "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"ii", ",", "1", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964870511766149*^9, 3.964870537030835*^9}, {
  3.964870598238103*^9, 3.964870625368714*^9}, {3.964872685349288*^9, 
  3.964872785377911*^9}, {3.964872944481517*^9, 3.964872945287474*^9}, {
  3.964877970080987*^9, 3.964877970180442*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[207]:=",ExpressionUUID->"11eea44e-62a3-48ad-b94e-ac9d6587ef60"],

