 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "53d053d4-0709-4e90-b0a5-693d59569fee"],
 ". The phase due to the atoms\[CloseCurlyQuote] positions is taken to be \
zero for the first atom and increase by \[Phi] for each subsequent atom. \
Assuming that the 5 atoms lie along the propagation direction of the incident \
field, there must be a phase difference of \[Phi] between each consecutive \
pair of atoms. If the interaction only occurs between first neighbours the \
variable transdd, which lists the coherent interactions among atoms, is given \
by"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9648689970376377`*^9, 3.964869024649825*^9}, {
   3.964869055455311*^9, 3.964869188975588*^9}, {3.964869230578914*^9, 
