Cell["\<\
It is possible to abbreviate the process of obtaining the differential \
equations by using MasterEquation, which is a wrapper for \
LiouvilleMasterEquation, LiouvilleLindbladian, LiouvilleCommutator, and Ham\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964876340979529*^9, 3.9648763795249147`*^9}, {
   3.964876440306537*^9, 3.964876449856335*^9}, {3.964876491074407*^9, 
