   3.965403760026206*^9, 3.965403801715444*^9}, {3.965404030805574*^9, 
   3.965404031153363*^9}, {3.965404138134541*^9, 3.965404140795439*^9}, {
   3.978611396035553*^9, 3.978611402818719*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "Optical pumping",ExpressionUUID->"4b0aac94-fd32-42df-9242-e09c9549a574"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Optical pumping is the process by which resonant light redistributes the \
population of atomic energy levels, creating a non-equilibrium population \
distribution or spin polarization. We set up the master equation for a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["\[InvisiblePrefixScriptBase]", "87"], "Rb"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"67ebce02-928d-42b2-b694-fe9e6888e449"],
 " atom in a four wave mixing configuration. We test the master equation \
under optical pumping conditions."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96531522401501*^9, 3.965315233164456*^9}, 
   3.96531534363879*^9, {3.965315499764625*^9, 3.965315518129793*^9}, {
   3.965315665096003*^9, 3.965315762634886*^9}, {3.965315796599818*^9, 
   3.965315810098307*^9}, 3.965315890595478*^9, {3.965403814905904*^9, 
   3.9654038239294147`*^9}, {3.965404088086923*^9, 3.9654041280746193`*^9}, 
   3.9654041861399393`*^9, {3.968596290227429*^9, 3.968596317285799*^9}, {
   3.9748911943792*^9, 
   3.9748911963216963`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4fea8a9-5c49-48be-8cb8-\
5311413ff909"],

