Cell["\<\
At this point, it is helpful to inspect the variable levels, as this provides \
a clearer understanding of how the atomic orbitals are organized and how they \
factor into the master equation, nothing the first number is simply the \
position of the level on the list while the other numbers are actual quantum \
numbers.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965414056254451*^9, 3.965414128309561*^9}, {
